# data/ is tracked deliberately: data/cache/ holds the committed LLM responses,
# and data/db + data/work hold the built ledger and the canonical document text
# the evidence endpoints re-slice. Together they let a reviewer run the whole
# thing with no API key. SQLite's sidecar files are transient, though.
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
